---
/* =========================================================
   PAGE METADATA
   ========================================================= */

const title =
  "Rocketeers | Marketplace Operations Case Study | Konstantinos Zafiropoulos";

/* =========================================================
   CASE STUDY METRICS
   ========================================================= */

const metrics = [
  {
    value: "23,000+",
    label: "Items sold",
  },
  {
    value: "6,455",
    label: "Seller feedback entries",
  },
  {
    value: "3,361",
    label: "Unique positive feedback",
  },
  {
    value: "807",
    label: "Store followers",
  },
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- =====================================================
         HEAD / SEO
         ===================================================== -->

    <meta charset="utf-8" />

    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Rocketeers marketplace operations case study by Konstantinos Zafiropoulos."
    />

    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <!-- ===================================================
           MAIN NAVIGATION
           =================================================== -->

      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a class="wordmark" href="/">
          KZ<span>.</span>
        </a>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/#projects">Projects</a>
          <a href="/#about">About</a>
          <a href="/#contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <!-- ===================================================
           HERO
           =================================================== -->

      <header class="hero">
        <a class="back-link" href="/#projects">← Back to projects</a>

        <p class="eyebrow">Marketplace operations · 2017–2024</p>

        <h1>Rocketeers</h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Building and operating a digital marketplace business across
          international customers, inventory, listings, pricing, fulfilment,
          seller performance, disputes, and day-to-day operations.
        </p>

        <!-- Project tags -->
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span>eBay</span>
          <span>Marketplace Operations</span>
          <span>Pricing</span>
          <span>Inventory</span>
          <span>Process Design</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- ===================================================
           KEY METRICS
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="metrics" aria-label="Rocketeers results">
        {
          metrics.map((metric) => (
            <article class="metric-card">
              <strong>{metric.value}</strong>
              <span>{metric.label}</span>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           SECTION 01 — OVERVIEW
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="case-section overview">
        <div class="section-label">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 — Overview</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>A marketplace business built from the operational level up.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Rocketeers was a digital marketplace operation I ran for seven
            years. I handled the practical systems behind the business rather
            than working on only one isolated part of the process.
          </p>

          <p>
            That included sourcing, catalogue management, listing creation,
            pricing, inventory, order handling, customer communication,
            returns, disputes, marketplace cases, and seller-performance
            monitoring.
          </p>

          <p>
            The business sold more than 23,000 items while maintaining zero
            negative seller feedback across its operating history.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           SECTION 02 — THE CHALLENGE
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="case-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 — The challenge</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>Manual work becomes a systems problem when volume grows.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Marketplace operations become increasingly difficult to manage as
            the catalogue expands.
          </p>

          <!-- Challenge cards -->
          <div class="challenge-grid">
            <article>
              <span class="card-number">01</span>

              <h3>Pricing</h3>

              <p>
                Large numbers of listings and variations made individual
                repricing increasingly inefficient.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article>
              <span class="card-number">02</span>

              <h3>Catalogue control</h3>

              <p>
                Listings needed consistent titles, attributes, availability,
                pricing, and marketplace-specific information.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article>
              <span class="card-number">03</span>

              <h3>Operational quality</h3>

              <p>
                Growth could not come at the expense of seller performance,
                customer service, or accurate fulfilment.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           SECTION 03 — OPERATIONS
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="case-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 — Operations</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>The work behind the storefront.</h2>

          <!-- Operations grid -->
          <div class="operations-grid">
            <div class="operation">
              <span>Marketplace</span>

              <strong>Listings & catalogue</strong>

              <p>
                Created, maintained, and improved marketplace listings across a
                large catalogue.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="operation">
              <span>Commercial</span>

              <strong>Pricing</strong>

              <p>
                Managed pricing decisions and developed more structured ways of
                handling repeated pricing work.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="operation">
              <span>Operations</span>

              <strong>Orders & inventory</strong>

              <p>
                Coordinated availability, order processing, stock-related
                decisions, and fulfilment workflows.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="operation">
              <span>Customer experience</span>

              <strong>Returns & disputes</strong>

              <p>
                Used eBay Seller Hub and Resolution Center extensively for
                returns, disputes, cases, and seller-performance management.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           SECTION 04 — EVIDENCE & RESULTS
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="case-section evidence">
        <div class="section-label">
          <p class="eyebrow">04 — Evidence & results</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>Marketplace performance backed by real operating history.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Rocketeers was not a conceptual project. It was a real operating
            business with years of marketplace activity and measurable seller
            performance.
          </p>

          <!-- Evidence cards -->
          <div class="evidence-grid">
            <article>
              <strong>0</strong>
              <span>Negative feedback</span>
            </article>

            <article>
              <strong>1</strong>
              <span>Neutral feedback</span>
            </article>

            <article>
              <strong>23,000+</strong>
              <span>Items sold</span>
            </article>

            <article>
              <strong>20+</strong>
              <span>Countries served</span>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           SECTION 05 — SKILLS DEMONSTRATED
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="case-section">
        <div class="section-label">
          <p class="eyebrow">05 — Skills demonstrated</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-content">
          <h2>Business ownership translated into operational capability.</h2>

          <!-- Skills list -->
          <div class="skills-list">
            <span>Marketplace operations</span>
            <span>eBay Seller Hub</span>
            <span>Resolution Center</span>
            <span>Pricing</span>
            <span>Inventory</span>
            <span>Catalogue management</span>
            <span>Customer experience</span>
            <span>Returns & disputes</span>
            <span>Process improvement</span>
            <span>Operational ownership</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===================================================
           NEXT PROJECT / RETURN CTA
           =================================================== -->

      <section class="project-end">
        <p class="eyebrow">Next</p>

        <h2>Explore the rest of the portfolio.</h2>

        <a class="text-link" href="/#projects">
          Back to selected work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- =====================================================
         FOOTER
         ===================================================== -->

    <footer>
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Konstantinos Zafiropoulos</span>
      <span>Built with Astro</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* =========================================================
     DESIGN TOKENS / GLOBAL THEME
     ========================================================= */

  :root {
    color: #e8edf3;
    background: #050b14;
    font-family:
      Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
      "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e8edf3;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(42, 167, 255, 0.12),
        transparent 34rem
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 15% 35%,
        rgba(255, 138, 0, 0.05),
        transparent 28rem
      ),
      #050b14;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     PAGE WIDTH / LAYOUT
     ========================================================= */

  main,
  footer {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: auto;
    padding-left: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    padding-right: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  /* =========================================================
     LINKS
     ========================================================= */

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     NAVIGATION
     ========================================================= */

  nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .wordmark {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.08em;
  }

  .wordmark span,
  .text-link span {
    color: #ff8a00;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: #b8c7d6;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     HERO
     ========================================================= */

  .hero {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: #7f95aa;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: #ff8a00;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  h3 {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: #b8c7d6;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hero-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-tags span {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid #203247;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #a9bbcc;
    background: rgba(8, 18, 32, 0.8);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     METRICS
     ========================================================= */

  .metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .metric-card {
    min-height: 145px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid #203247;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(42, 167, 255, 0.08),
        rgba(255, 138, 0, 0.025)
      ),
      rgba(8, 18, 32, 0.82);
  }

  .metric-card strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #2aa7ff;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .metric-card span {
    color: #9fb1c2;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     CASE STUDY SECTIONS
     ========================================================= */

  .case-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, 0.32fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7.5rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #203247;
  }

  .section-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .section-content > p {
    color: #a9bbcc;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lead {
    color: #d7e0e8 !important;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     CHALLENGE CARDS
     ========================================================= */

  .challenge-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .challenge-grid article {
    padding: 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid #28394b;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(9, 18, 31, 0.9);
  }

  .card-number {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
    color: #ff8a00;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .challenge-grid p {
    color: #94a8ba;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     OPERATIONS GRID
     ========================================================= */

  .operations-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .operation {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid #2aa7ff;
    background: rgba(8, 17, 30, 0.72);
  }

  .operation > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: #ff8a00;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .operation strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .operation p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: #91a4b7;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     EVIDENCE / RESULT CARDS
     ========================================================= */

  .evidence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .evidence-grid article {
    padding: 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid #203247;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(8, 17, 30, 0.72);
  }

  .evidence-grid strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    color: #ff8a00;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }

  .evidence-grid span {
    color: #91a4b7;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     SKILLS
     ========================================================= */

  .skills-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .skills-list span {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid #285078;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #c5d5e4;
    background: rgba(8, 25, 42, 0.78);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     PROJECT END / CTA
     ========================================================= */

  .project-end {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #203247;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #e8edf3;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     FOOTER
     ========================================================= */

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #203247;
    color: #7f95aa;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  /* =========================================================
     RESPONSIVE / TABLET
     ========================================================= */

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .metrics {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .case-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .challenge-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .evidence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  /* =========================================================
     RESPONSIVE / MOBILE
     ========================================================= */

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    nav {
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .nav-links {
      gap: 0.8rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: 4rem;
    }

    .metrics,
    .evidence-grid,
    .operations-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .metric-card {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    footer {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>